/*
  AIProviderSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0200 · AIProviderSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `AIProviderSection` resolves (table "AIProviderSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/AIProviderSection.tsx). The second group promotes the
  two Azure-flavor descriptive option labels (hardcoded inline in the web `<Select>`)
  to facade keys so the Swift sources hold no English literals. The third group backs
  the native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / empty / error / a11y copy).

  Parity note on the validate banners: the web values are i18next templates
  `OK — pinned to {{ip}}` / `OK — {{model}} reachable`; the native catalog uses the
  equivalent positional `String(format:)` `%@` specifier so the interpolation matches.
  Provider brand titles (OpenAI / Anthropic / Azure AI / Google / Ollama / LM Studio /
  llama.cpp) are proper nouns rendered verbatim, exactly as the web hardcodes them.
*/

